approval round-trip <30s (achieved ~2s)."}, {"id": "docs_blueprint_m9", "label": "M9 \u2014 Capability Packs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/BLUEPRINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SHIPPED 2026-07-06 (ADR-0012). The kernel becomes domain-free: composeRegistry(enabled) = workspace-only core + enabled packs' tools. 4 seed packs; support-ops installed live via the API to prove the exit criterion."}, {"id": "docs_blueprint_m9_5", "label": "M9.5 \u2014 Personal life expansion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/BLUEPRINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rolling, one pack at a time. WhatsApp shipped first (ADR-0013, 2026-07-07) \u2014 the highest-trust destination per \u00a72.1's personal-channel reality check."}, {"id": "docs_blueprint_m10", "label": "M10 \u2014 Learning Loop", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/BLUEPRINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "VERIFIED 2026-07-08 (ADR-0014). The coding loop (M6) with the verifier swapped: propose playbook \u2192 gym verifies \u2192 adopt iff no regression. Exit: 2 consecutive months of rising eval scores + falling cost/task without manual prompt editing."}, {"id": "docs_blueprint_north_star", "label": "1. North Star", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/BLUEPRINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_blueprint_core_principles", "label": "3. Core Principles (the constitution)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/BLUEPRINT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_blueprint_system_architecture", "label": "4. System Architecture", "file_type": "conce